description	"Boss Rugor Nass

A hearty commander with support skills and a large cannon.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- The Boss's Personal Energy Shield (Staff Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Defense (3)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- 10% more knockback
> Broad Shield
-- 12% longer
-- 500% thicker
> Tower Shield
-- 43% shorter
-- 1100% thicker
- Booma Cannon (Minigun 3)
-- Explodes/shocks/pushes/drains on hit
-- 60% more damage
-- 200% more FP damage
-- 1200% slower RoF
-- 84% smaller splash
-- 75% slower mag reload
- The Boss's Big Blue Balls (2) (Pulse Grenades)
-- Disarms on det
-- 100% more damage

^5Powers:
- Protect (1) ^5{Light's Beacon}

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (1)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Melee Resist
- Healing (3)
- Rally
- Force Block (1)
- Underwater Breathing
- Aerial Resource Regen
- 25% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dash (1) ^3[Melee CS2]"